            stem: "A builder constructed a new house on speculation and sold it to a buyer under a contract and deed that said nothing about the condition of the house. Eight months after closing, the buyer discovered that the foundation had been poured improperly, making the house unfit to live in. The buyer sued the builder for the cost of repair.",
